<section id="faq" class="faq section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2 id="faq-heading" class="display faq__title">Common questions</h2>

    <div class="faq__list">
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Do you clean both homes and offices?</summary>
        <p>
          Yes. Residential and commercial spaces are both part of our weekly
          service. We will tailor the checklist to your layout — open offices,
          suites, and family homes all work.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Will I get the same cleaners every week?</summary>
        <p>
          That is the goal. We assign a consistent team to your space so they
          learn your preferences and show up on schedule without re-explaining
          the details each visit.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>How does pricing work?</summary>
        <p>
          We quote a flat weekly rate based on your space size and service type.
          No surge pricing, no last-minute add-ons at the door. Your quote email
          spells out exactly what is included.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>What areas do you serve?</summary>
        <p>
          All Central Florida cities — Orlando, Winter Park, Kissimmee, Sanford,
          Apopka, Oviedo, and surrounding communities. Not sure if you are in
          range? Send a quote request with your city.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Are your cleaners insured and background-checked?</summary>
        <p>
          Yes. Every team member is background-checked, and Cleaning Weekly
          carries insurance for residential and commercial work. We are happy to
          provide proof before your first visit.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq__title {
    margin: 0 0 clamp(var(--space-8), 4vw, var(--space-12));
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    color: var(--teal-deep);
  }

  .faq__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .faq__item {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--ground);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .faq__item summary {
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .faq__item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq__item summary::after {
    content: "+";
    float: right;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .faq__item[open] summary::after {
    content: "−";
  }

  .faq__item p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
</style>
